  Scoped rule starters; select the editor's fenced output.
  Insert Markdown as written; drop this header. No agent-content framing in rules.
  pathPattern: YAML-safe path glob, without surrounding quotes or brace expansion ({a,b}).
    Copilot splits applyTo on commas, so braces break matching. For several patterns,
